      "side": 1,
      "message": "The commit message talks about CONFIG_FINEIBT, but the actual change is to add `# CONFIG_CFI_AUTO_DEFAULT is not set`. Please also explain in the commit message why CFI_AUTO_DEFAULT is disabled and how that results in FINEIBT being disabled. Based on the Kconfig definition, CFI_AUTO_DEFAULT _depends on_ FINEIBT which means disabling it won\u0027t disable FINEIBT.",
      "revId": "f4db7b417d7e3ecba53975a913ceeeaf1f10882d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
